{
  "id": "PSA.58",
  "number": "58",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psaumes 58",
  "copyright": "Texte libre de droits",
  "verseCount": 12,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "58",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 58"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "58",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Au chef de musique. Al-Tashkheth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". De David. Mictam",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Est-ce que vraiment la justice se tait ? Prononcez-vous [ce qui est juste] ? Vous, fils des hommes, jugez-vous avec droiture ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bien plutôt, dans le cœur, vous commettez des iniquités ; dans le pays, vous pesez",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "la violence de vos mains.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Les méchants se sont égarés dès la matrice ; ils errent dès le ventre, parlant le mensonge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ils ont un venin semblable au venin d'un serpent, comme l'aspic sourd qui se bouche l'oreille,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qui n'entend pas la voix des charmeurs, du sorcier expert en sorcelleries.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.58.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.58.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! dans leur bouche brise leurs dents ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.58.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.58.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! arrache les grosses dents des jeunes lions.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qu'ils se fondent comme des eaux qui s'écoulent ! S'il ajuste ses flèches, qu'elles soient comme cassées",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qu'ils soient comme une limace qui va se fondant ! Comme l'avorton d'une femme, qu'ils ne voient pas le soleil !",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avant que vos chaudières aient senti les épines, vertes ou enflammées, le tourbillon les emportera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Le juste se réjouira quand il verra la vengeance ; il lavera ses pieds",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "dans le sang du méchant.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 58:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et l'homme dira : Certainement il y a un fruit pour le juste, certainement il y a un",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.58.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.58.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "qui juge sur la terre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.58.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.58.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PSA.59",
    "number": "59",
    "bookId": "PSA"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "PSA.57",
    "number": "57",
